{"duration": 26.436, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A physician lifted a sick patient\u2019s scab and popped it into his mouth.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.93}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Colleagues laughed, insisting pellagra spread like any germ.", "start": 3.13, "end": 5.666}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They warned him he\u2019d ruin his career.", "start": 5.746, "end": 7.227}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Goldberger refuses to back down.", "start": 7.427, "end": 9.091}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He gathers volunteers for a \u201cfilth party\u201d.", "start": 9.171, "end": 10.899}, {"beat": 2, "text": "He injects pellagric blood and even swallows the scabs himself.", "start": 10.979, "end": 13.835}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like tasting a mystery flavor to prove it isn\u2019t poison.", "start": 14.035, "end": 16.861}, {"beat": 4, "text": "His self\u2011experiment shows the disease comes from a poor diet, not an infectious germ.", "start": 17.061, "end": 20.787}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The irony? His daring act finally silenced critics, yet the cure\u2014niacin\u2014was discovered years later.", "start": 20.987, "end": 25.536}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.094, "end": 0.119, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "physician", "start": 0.169, "end": 0.444, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lifted", "start": 0.494, "end": 0.694, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 0.719, "end": 0.744, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "sick", "start": 0.819, "end": 0.919, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "patient\u2019s", "start": 0.969, "end": 1.244, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "scab", "start": 1.269, "end": 1.719, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "and", "start": 1.794, "end": 1.869, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "popped", "start": 1.919, "end": 2.119, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "it", "start": 2.144, "end": 2.194, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "into", "start": 2.219, "end": 2.344, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 2.369, "end": 2.444, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "mouth.",